OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786623512
OL,3,CSolar eclipse wows Cumbria while
OL,4,Csouthern Scotland left in the shade
OL,6,FThose hoping to catch a glimpse in the
OL,7,Fsouth of Scotland were largely
OL,8,Fdisappointed, however, as cloud cover
OL,9,Fspoiled the view.
OL,11,FWatch yesterday's solar eclipse as
OL,12,Ffilmed in St Bees.
OL,14,FIn St Bees, however, hundreds gathered
OL,15,Fon the beach to witness the spectacle,
OL,16,Fand they did not leave disappointed.
