OL,3,CSolar eclipse wows Cumbria while
OL,4,Csouthern Scotland left in the shade
OL,6,FIn Helsington Laithes, near Kendal,
OL,7,FGraham Fell from the Kendal Eddington
OL,8,FAstronomical Society set up his
OL,9,Ftelescope so that everyone could see
OL,10,Fthe eclipse through it.
OL,12,FThe set-up allowed people to get a
OL,13,Fgood view without the need for
OL,14,Fprotective eye-wear.
OL,16,FDid you manage to see the eclipse, and
OL,17,Fdid you take any photographs of the
OL,18,Fspectacle? If so, let ITV Border know!
OL,19,FEmail us at amyandian@itv.com
